      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Original story: The Avengers in... \"Let All Men Bring Together\" Scarlet Witch is imprisoned by the almighty Dormammu- but not if Vision can help it! The Avengers’ resident synthezoid travels to the Dark Dimension to save the woman he loves. But can Vision, a creation of science, hold battle with Marvel’s mightiest mystic? Vision and Scarlet Witch vs. Umar and the hellish Dormammu!"
    },
